    "created_at": "2026-02-12T19:50:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-02-12T19:50:32Z",
    "body": "Thanks for the example.\n\nMaking options become disabled when they are inside a disabled optgroup makes sense, but I have a few concerns:\n- Unforeseen compat issues with how this has worked for decades\n- We would have to tweak lots of UA styles for base and auto appearance modes in order to prevent rendering changes. The UA styles for disabled options would start applying, and when combined with existing styles for disabled optgroups I think we might end up with double transparency/opacity or other issues.\n- Activation behavior would probably still work as expected, but would need double checking.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
